{
  "name": "Track Booking.com hotel prices daily in Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Track Booking.com hotel prices in Google Sheets\nEvery morning, this workflow runs the [Booking.com Hotels Scraper & Price Tracker](https://apify.com/myth84/booking-hotels-scraper) on Apify for one destination and a 3-night stay 30 days ahead, then appends **one row per property** to a Google Sheet:\n\n`date`, `checkIn`, `searchLocation`, `title`, `priceTotal` (before the excluded taxes), `priceTotalAllIn` (taxes included), `currency`, `rating` (out of 10), `reviewCount`, `starRating`, `url`.\n\nEach run prices a stay that starts 30 days later (`checkIn`), so the sheet tracks what a stay one month ahead costs, day after day: filter on `title` and chart `priceTotalAllIn` by `date`.\n\nNo personal data: nothing about guests or reviewers.\n\nThe workflow calls a paid Apify Actor built by Flatrow Data Studio (the author of this workflow).",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "ea76c509-3989-48dc-ba9e-d83615fb51cc",
      "name": "Note: what this workflow does",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Apify credential\nCreate a free account on apify.com and copy your API token (Apify Console > Settings > API & Integrations).\n\nIn **Run Booking.com Hotels Scraper**, create a **Header Auth** credential:\n- Name: `Authorization`\n- Value: `Bearer <your-apify-token>`\n\n### 2. Google Sheets credential\nCreate an empty Google Sheet. In **Append rows to Google Sheets**, connect a Google Sheets credential, then paste the sheet URL in **Document**. Rows go to the first tab; the first run writes the header row.\n\n### 3. Test, then activate\nClick **Execute workflow**: 20 results take about a minute. Then activate (publish) the workflow: it runs every day at 7:00 in the time zone of your n8n.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "03395cfd-57d3-46df-b59f-5c5741960550",
      "name": "Note: credentials",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -20,
        -460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Change the city or the stay\nEdit the **JSON** body of **Run Booking.com Hotels Scraper**:\n- `locations`: one or more destinations, written as on Booking.com (`\"Paris, France\"`); `maxResults` applies to each one\n- `checkInDaysFromNow` and `nights`: the stay, counted from the day of the run; or fixed `checkIn` and `checkOut` dates (YYYY-MM-DD)\n- `adults`, `currency`, and filters such as `starRatings`, `minReviewScore` or `sortBy`\n\nEvery input field is documented on the [Actor page](https://apify.com/myth84/booking-hotels-scraper). Change the hour in **Every day at 7:00**.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "d3629a20-017c-409f-8416-637891296077",
      "name": "Note: change the city or the stay",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        460,
        -460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Cost\nPay per result, compute and proxies included: $2.50 per 1,000 properties on the Apify Free plan, from $1.69 on paid plans. With `maxResults` at 20: about $0.05 per run, about $1.50 a month for a daily run, within the $5 monthly credit of the Apify Free plan.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "c261bd6d-ebd4-46b3-a198-d277f99dca47",
      "name": "Note: cost",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -20,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "triggerAtHour": 7
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "f694191f-7b35-4f50-a20d-96a914fb71e2",
      "name": "Every day at 7:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        40,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/myth84~booking-hotels-scraper/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"locations\": [\n    \"Lisbon, Portugal\"\n  ],\n  \"checkInDaysFromNow\": 30,\n  \"nights\": 3,\n  \"adults\": 2,\n  \"currency\": \"EUR\",\n  \"maxResults\": 20\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000
        }
      },
      "id": "26627d15-d2b1-4cfe-b5ec-ec239f477e9e",
      "name": "Run Booking.com Hotels Scraper",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [
        260,
        40
      ],
      "notes": "Booking.com Hotels Scraper & Price Tracker on Apify. Apify waits for the run to finish and returns its rows; n8n turns each row into one item."
    },
    {
